  "releaseNotes": "## 12.1.2\n\n### Fixes\n- The alignment flyout now dismisses automatically after an alignment is chosen.\n- Superscript and subscript can now be springloaded on an empty caret, so toggling them with no selection affects the next text you type.\n- When Backspace merges a paragraph into the one before it, the caret is now anchored to the previous paragraph at the merge point.\n- The formatting toolbar now reflects the caret's formatting immediately after Backspace or Delete instead of lagging by one keystroke.",
